lisa-design:
- ci.yml passes `images` as a literal copy of release.yml's list (agent, agent-ci, agent-custodian; context .) rather than relying on the `[{}]` default, which would scan only Dockerfile as `agent`. The two lists must stay equal; a comment in ci.yml points at release.yml. Reusable-workflow inputs can't be shared across caller files, so the duplication is deliberate.
- AGENTS.md's Commands paragraph names the non-gating image check.
